    read the way the memory reads an answer: when they are the same entries the answer is
    settled and the first is kept, and when they differ the harness answers the one the
    memory's own writing carries more of, which is the reading of an answer this harness
    makes anyway. A derivation that wrote no answer leaves the other one standing.
